<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not well tested on a live basis, compared with Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Steers: select to mostly choice 2-4 1150-1250 lb 2 ld, $72.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested on a carcass basis. Confirmed: 100. Week to date: 6,900.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
</text>
